830
01:20:41.083 --> 01:20:43.250
I have an army.

831
01:20:43.333 --> 01:20:45.541
Oh, yeah? Well, I've got my mom.

832
01:20:53.875 --> 01:20:55.291
I wish we had more time, Ma.

833
01:20:56.375 --> 01:20:57.916
It's quality, not quantity.

834
