<i>♪ But whatever it is you think you need ♪</i>

992
01:41:49.375 --> 01:41:51.958
<i>♪ You better grab it fast ♪</i>

993
01:41:54.208 --> 01:41:59.291
<i>♪ Yonder stands your orphan with his gun ♪</i>

994
01:42:02.375 --> 01:42:07.291
<i>♪ Crying like a fire in the sun ♪</i>

995
