<i>♪ Is drawing crazy patterns
On your sheets ♪</i>

1001
01:43:00.000 --> 01:43:05.000
<i>♪ The sky too now is folding up on you ♪</i>

1002
01:43:08.333 --> 01:43:12.958
<i>♪ And it's all over now
Baby Blue ♪</i>

1003
01:43:15.458 --> 01:43:17.416
<i>♪ It's all over ♪</i>

1004
01:43:19.833 --> 01:43:21.291
<i>♪ Baby Blue ♪</i>

1005
01:43:24.041 --> 01:43:26.000
<i>♪ It's all over, baby ♪</i>

1006
01:43:27.791 --> 01:43:29.375
<i>♪ Baby Blue ♪</i>

1007
