If I could take it back...

1010
01:44:34.375 --> 01:44:35.458
I know.

1011
01:44:36.458 --> 01:44:38.000
But you tried to save him.

1012
01:44:39.833 --> 01:44:40.833
Still.

1013
01:44:42.500 --> 01:44:43.833
And you saved me.

1014
01:44:49.125 --> 01:44:50.291
Thank you.

1015
